# React Guardrails

Component design:
- functional components with composition-first approach
- keep components focused and predictable
- extract reusable behavior into custom hooks when appropriate

Hooks discipline:
- keep hook dependency arrays complete and stable
- avoid suppressing `exhaustive-deps` without explicit rationale
- avoid unstable inline dependencies in effects/memos/callbacks

Quality:
- keep state ownership explicit
- avoid hidden side effects
- validate accessibility basics in user-facing component changes
